    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "fishing rod with the line connected to the tip (i.e. without a reel or guides)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼は、昔ながらの「のべ竿」で鯉を釣っていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "川辺で、一本の「のべ竿」を構えて、静かに釣り糸を垂れていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「のべ竿」は、シンプルな構造だからこそ、繊細なアタリが伝わる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "fishing rod made of a single piece of bamboo",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
